{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":37.119998931884766,"text":"A metal cone, scorched and brown on the outside, with three small seats inside. In May 1969, it traveled to the moon with three astronauts, Stafford, Young, and Cernan, and rehearsed the landing. It went down to within 15 kilometers of the surface and came back up, without touching down. Two months later, Apollo 11 took the step. On the way home, the capsule hit the atmosphere so fast that the air burned it, which is why it is black. It has been in London on loan since 1978, and is the only capsule that went to the moon that is kept outside the USA.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.3799999952316284},{"word":"metal","start":0.3799999952316284,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"cone","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":1.1799999475479126},{"word":"scorched","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":1.8799999952316284},{"word":"and","start":1.8799999952316284,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"brown","start":2.4200000762939453,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"on","start":2.4200000762939453,"end":2.5799999237060547},{"word":"the","start":2.5799999237060547,"end":3.140000104904175},{"word":"outside","start":3.140000104904175,"end":3.140000104904175},{"word":"with","start":3.640000104904175,"end":3.7799999713897705},{"word":"three","start":3.7799999713897705,"end":4.159999847412109},{"word":"small","start":4.159999847412109,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"seats","start":4.519999980926514,"end":4.820000171661377},{"word":"inside","start":4.820000171661377,"end":5.28000020980835},{"word":"In","start":6.119999885559082,"end":6.119999885559082},{"word":"May","start":6.119999885559082,"end":6.420000076293945},{"word":"1969","start":6.420000076293945,"end":7.340000152587891},{"word":"it","start":7.760000228881836,"end":7.760000228881836},{"word":"traveled","start":7.760000228881836,"end":8.0600004196167},{"word":"to","start":8.0600004196167,"end":8.239999771118164},{"word":"the","start":8.23999977111